{
  "description": "The skills field and where its names resolve. A 'resolve-' case gives 'overlays', 'requested', optional 'files' and 'catalogs' (each read as in catalog.json, with its 'label'), an optional 'order' of labels and 'fetches' (absent, true); 'expect' gives each skill in composition order and by name with its 'origin' ('bundled', 'source', 'catalog', 'missing', 'ambiguous'), the 'source' as shown, 'pin', 'catalog' or 'catalogs'; the 'missing', 'ambiguous', 'unpinned' and 'not_fetched' reports; what is 'delivered', by name, and the 'collisions'. A 'fetched-' case gives a skill's 'name', the 'fetched' files and an optional 'pin'; 'expect' gives its tree 'digest', or an 'error'.",
  "spec": "spec/v0/skills.md",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "resolve-bundled-only",
      "description": "Bundled skills name no source and need no catalog.",
      "overlays": {
        "a": {
          "skills": [
            "k"
          ]
        }
      },
      "requested": [
        "a"
      ],
      "files": {
        "a": [
          "skills/k/SKILL.md",
          "skills/other/SKILL.md"
        ]
      },
      "expect": {
        "skills": [
          {
            "name": "k",
            "origin": "bundled",
            "overlay": "a"
          },
          {
            "name": "other",
            "origin": "bundled",
            "overlay": "a"
          }
        ],
        "missing": [],
        "ambiguous": [],
        "unpinned": [],
        "not_fetched": [],
        "delivered": {
          "k": "a",
          "other": "a"
        },
        "collisions": []
      }
    },
